What it does: Identifies which authoritative nameservers hold the master DNS records for the domain zone.

The Analogy: The sign at the registrar office saying: "The official files for SneakerHub are stored at Cloudflare's records vault."

sneakerhub.com Setup: You bought your domain at GoDaddy, but you manage your live DNS records on Cloudflare:

Plaintext
sneakerhub.com.    86400    IN    NS    ns1.cloudflare.com.
sneakerhub.com.    86400    IN    NS    ns2.cloudflare.com.
